      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUNNELL GIRL (1) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Finished second (22.76) at Gosford last time making it three minors on end. Sure to be about the mark. DOLLY DAWN (4) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 5.5 lengths sixth (18.12) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 300m. Solid beginner and with a good start can clear the tricky draw. Should be in this for a long way. SUPER (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Nature Boy (17.65) in a Grade 5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Must be included in calculations. BAD GIRL SALLY (8) is right in the mix.",
